==Battleground==
*7 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*4 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*4 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns as the boss after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*4 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*4 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 116.67 seconds<sup>3,500f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage shouldn't be too hard, as every enemy here has a Death Surge. Given the surge-heavy nature of Omens, you should be packing a bunch of Surge Immune units. Just spam stuff and you should win with relative ease.

